%%{init: {'sequence': {'width': 220}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Browser)
    participant A as Authenticator
    participant S as Server

    C->>S: 1. POST /register/start (username)
    Note over S: Generate & store challenge
    S-->>C: 2. Return options (challenge, rpId, user info)

    C->>A: 3. navigator.credentials.create()
    Note over A: Generate key pair
    Note over A: Create attestation object
    A-->>C: 4. Return attestation object + client data

    C->>S: 5. POST /register/finish
    Note over S: Verify client data
    Note over S: Verify attestation
    Note over S: Extract & store public key
    S-->>C: 6. Registration success